allocateTokens;z;t

t←'EWC Synchronisation'

:Trap 2 ⍝ SYNTAX ERROR in v18.2
     z←↑⎕TALLOC 0
     :If (≢z)≥i←z[;2]⍳⊂t
         TOKENRANGE←z[i;1]
     :Else
         TOKENRANGE←⎕TALLOC 1 t
     :EndIf
     TOKENSTEP←10*-⌈10⍟MAXSESSIONS+1
     (WG_TOKENBASE DQ_TOKENBASE)←TOKENRANGE+0.1 0.2
     (WGID_TOKENBASE WGID_TOKENSTEP)←(-TOKENRANGE)¯1E¯12 ⍝ A token per WG/WX reply, in the negated range
 :Else
     TOKENSTEP←1
     (WG_TOKENBASE DQ_TOKENBASE)←(0 1×1+MAXSESSIONS)+30⊥⎕A⍳'EWC' ⍝ Think of a number
     (WGID_TOKENBASE WGID_TOKENSTEP)←¯1E9 ¯1
 :EndTrap

DEQUEUEING←⍬
